# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and in every working tree.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true writes CRLF files.
# eslint-config-airbnb enforces linebreak-style: unix, and react-scripts treats
# eslint errors as build failures, so `npm run build` fails on every source file
# even though the committed blobs are already LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalized.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf  binary
*.eot  binary
